Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"polardb__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（本身就是云服务；Serverless 形态）。 PolarDB 本身就是阿里云托管服务，Serverless 按量计费 官方文档。 无中立第三方托管，阿里云绑定 社区共识。 开源版可自建，但与云版本能力有差异 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（本身就是云服务；Serverless 形态）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB 本身就是阿里云托管服务，Serverless 按量计费 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无中立第三方托管，阿里云绑定 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>开源版可自建，但与云版本能力有差异 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (is itself a cloud service; serverless form). PolarDB is itself an Alibaba Cloud managed service with serverless pay-per-use <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No neutral third-p…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (is itself a cloud service; serverless form).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB is itself an Alibaba Cloud managed service with serverless pay-per-use <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No neutral third-party hosting; Alibaba Cloud-bound <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Open-source edition is self-hostable but differs from the cloud edition <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（兼容 MySQL/PG 工具链；DTS 数据传输服务）。 MySQL 版：LOAD DATA、mydumper 等 MySQL 工具直接可用 官方文档。 PG 版：COPY、pg_dump/pg_restore 可用 官方文档。 阿里云 DTS/数据传输服务做迁移与持续同步 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（兼容 MySQL/PG 工具链；DTS 数据传输服务）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 版：LOAD DATA、mydumper 等 MySQL 工具直接可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>PG 版：COPY、pg_dump/pg_restore 可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>阿里云 DTS/数据传输服务做迁移与持续同步 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (MySQL/PG toolchain compatible; DTS transfer service). MySQL edition: LOAD DATA, mydumper and other MySQL tools work directly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. PG edition: COPY,…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (MySQL/PG toolchain compatible; DTS transfer service).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL edition: LOAD DATA, mydumper and other MySQL tools work directly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>PG edition: COPY, pg_dump/pg_restore available <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Alibaba Cloud DTS/data-transmission service for migration and ongoing sync <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。三引擎通用 SQL 审计功能：EnableSqlAudit / DisableSqlAudit / DescribeSqlAuditInfo，审计日志可接入阿里云日志服务 SLS（CheckSqlAuditSlsStatus 校验接入状态）；控制台开启后，SQL 审计日志写入 SLS 的 Project/Logstore，…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。三引擎通用 SQL 审计功能：<code>EnableSqlAudit</code> / <code>DisableSqlAudit</code> / <code>DescribeSqlAuditInfo</code>，审计日志可接入阿里云日志服务 SLS（<code>CheckSqlAuditSlsStatus</code> 校验接入状态）；控制台开启后，SQL 审计日志写入 SLS 的 Project/Logstore，可检索分析。MySQL 8.0.1.1.3 起&quot;支持新版本的审计日志格式，增加了 VIP 信息&quot;（官方内核发布说明）；社区笔记提及内置 <code>POLARDB_AUDIT_LOG</code>（社区共识，待官方文档交叉验证）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. SQL auditing available across all three engines: EnableSqlAudit / DisableSqlAudit / DescribeSqlAuditInfo; audit logs can be shipped to Alibaba …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. SQL auditing available across all three engines: <code>EnableSqlAudit</code> / <code>DisableSqlAudit</code> / <code>DescribeSqlAuditInfo</code>; audit logs can be shipped to Alibaba Cloud Log Service (SLS) (<code>CheckSqlAuditSlsStatus</code> verifies SLS integration); once enabled in the console, SQL audit logs are written to an SLS Project/Logstore for search and analysis. MySQL 8.0.1.1.3+ &quot;supports a new audit log format with VIP information added&quot; (official kernel release notes); community notes mention a built-in <code>POLARDB_AUDIT_LOG</code> (community consensus, pending cross-verification against official docs).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（PG 版有 postgres_fdw；MySQL 版无外部表）。 PolarDB-PG：postgres_fdw、dblink 可用（受扩展白名单限制）官方文档。 PolarDB-MySQL：无外部表语义 社区共识。 跨库查询多在应用层或 DTS 同步后解决 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（PG 版有 postgres_fdw；MySQL 版无外部表）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB-PG：postgres_fdw、dblink 可用（受扩展白名单限制）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>PolarDB-MySQL：无外部表语义 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>跨库查询多在应用层或 DTS 同步后解决 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (PG edition has postgres_fdw; MySQL edition has none). PolarDB-PG: postgres_fdw and dblink available (extension allowlist applies) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Po…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (PG edition has postgres_fdw; MySQL edition has none).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB-PG: postgres_fdw and dblink available (extension allowlist applies) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>PolarDB-MySQL: no external-table semantics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-database queries are usually solved in the app layer or after DTS sync <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（binlog/逻辑复制兼容；DTS、Debezium）。 MySQL 版 binlog 与社区兼容，可接 Canal/Debezium 官方文档。 PG 版逻辑复制可用 官方文档。 DTS 持续同步是云上标准链路 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（binlog/逻辑复制兼容；DTS、Debezium）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 版 binlog 与社区兼容，可接 Canal/Debezium <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>PG 版逻辑复制可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>DTS 持续同步是云上标准链路 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (binlog/logical-replication compatible; DTS, Debezium). MySQL edition binlog is community-compatible; works with Canal/Debezium <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. PG edition logi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (binlog/logical-replication compatible; DTS, Debezium).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL edition binlog is community-compatible; works with Canal/Debezium <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>PG edition logical replication available <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>DTS ongoing sync is the standard cloud path <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（同源分区+定时任务；无原生行级 TTL）。 MySQL/PG 版继承各自生态的分区过期做法 官方文档。 无原生行级 TTL 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（同源分区+定时任务；无原生行级 TTL）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL/PG 版继承各自生态的分区过期做法 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生行级 TTL <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Same-lineage partition expiry; no native row-level TTL). MySQL/PG flavors inherit their ecosystems&#x27; partition-expiry patterns <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native row-leve…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Same-lineage partition expiry; no native row-level TTL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL/PG flavors inherit their ecosystems&#x27; partition-expiry patterns <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native row-level TTL <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（PG 版四类同社区 PG；MySQL 版在线 DDL 有限）。 一、只改定义，不碰数据：PG 版同社区 PG（加可空列/非 volatile 默认列/重命名/删列标记/NOT VALID 约束/COMMENT，O(1)）官方文档；MySQL 版同 InnoDB online DDL，加列多可在线 社区共识。 二、重写数据，但数据…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（PG 版四类同社区 PG；MySQL 版在线 DDL 有限）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一、只改定义，不碰数据：PG 版同社区 PG（加可空列/非 volatile 默认列/重命名/删列标记/NOT VALID 约束/COMMENT，O(1)）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；MySQL 版同 InnoDB online DDL，加列多可在线 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>二、重写数据，但数据住哪不变：PG 版同社区 PG（改列类型需重写；CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY 在线建索引；VACUUM FULL/CLUSTER 锁表）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>；MySQL 版改主键/列类型仍重建，大表建议 gh-ost <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>三、搬数据：PG 版同社区 PG（改分区键/分区策略、分区合并拆分、CLUSTER 重排需重建，不在线）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>四、验证约束：PG 版同社区 PG（NOT VALID + VALIDATE CONSTRAINT 两阶段）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>差异核验：未找到阿里云官方文档对 PolarDB PG 引擎层 DDL 差异的声明 <code>未找到证据</code>。</li>\n<li>规模：第二、四类代价 O(n)，小表大表两个世界 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>语义：PG 版 DDL 事务性/锁/长事务卡 DDL 同社区 PG（CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY 不能在事务块里跑）；MySQL 版 DDL 非事务性（隐式提交）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (PG flavor follows community PG&#x27;s four categories; MySQL flavor&#x27;s online DDL is limited). 1. Definition-only changes (metadata, O(1)): PG flavor match…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (PG flavor follows community PG&#x27;s four categories; MySQL flavor&#x27;s online DDL is limited).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>1. Definition-only changes (metadata, O(1)): PG flavor matches community PG (nullable / non-volatile-default columns, renames, DROP COLUMN tombstones, NOT VALID constraints, COMMENT — O(1)) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; MySQL flavor follows InnoDB online DDL, most add-column ops online <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>2. Data rewrite, location unchanged: PG flavor matches community PG (type changes rewrite; CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY builds online; VACUUM FULL / CLUSTER lock the table) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>; MySQL flavor PK changes / type changes still rebuild — gh-ost advised for huge tables <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>3. Data relocation: PG flavor matches community PG (changing partition keys/strategy, partition merge/split, CLUSTER reordering require rebuilds, not online) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>4. Constraint validation: PG flavor matches community PG (NOT VALID + VALIDATE CONSTRAINT two-phase) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Difference check: no engine-level DDL differences for PolarDB&#x27;s PG flavor found in Alibaba Cloud&#x27;s official docs <code>(no evidence found)</code>.</li>\n<li>Scale: categories 2 and 4 cost O(n) — small and huge tables are two different worlds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Semantics: PG flavor&#x27;s DDL transactionality / locking / long-transaction-stalls-DDL match community PG (CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY cannot run in a transaction block); MySQL flavor DDL is non-transactional (implicit commit) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（集群级隔离为主，无资源组）。 租户隔离靠多集群，单集群内无细粒度资源组 社区共识。 读写分离+代理可做业务级分流 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（集群级隔离为主，无资源组）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>租户隔离靠多集群，单集群内无细粒度资源组 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>读写分离+代理可做业务级分流 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Mostly cluster-level isolation). Tenant isolation via multiple clusters; no fine-grained in-cluster resource groups <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Read/write splitting +…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Mostly cluster-level isolation).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tenant isolation via multiple clusters; no fine-grained in-cluster resource groups <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Read/write splitting + proxy can separate workload classes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（全球多活网络（GDN））。 PolarDB GDN 支持跨地域集群，写单主、读就近 官方文档。 跨区延迟 &lt;100ms 场景可用，延迟高则体验下降 官方文档。 多活写仍是单主语义 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（全球多活网络（GDN））。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB GDN 支持跨地域集群，写单主、读就近 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨区延迟 &lt;100ms 场景可用，延迟高则体验下降 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>多活写仍是单主语义 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Global active network (GDN)). PolarDB GDN supports cross-region clusters: single writer, local reads <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Works where cross-region latency is &lt;100m…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Global active network (GDN)).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB GDN supports cross-region clusters: single writer, local reads <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Works where cross-region latency is &lt;100ms; degrades beyond <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Multi-active is still single-writer semantics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（一写多读快速切换）。 共享存储一写多读，主故障只读节点快速提升，RTO 秒级 官方文档。 RPO≈0（Redo 日志共享）官方文档。 切换对长连接有闪断，应用需重连 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（一写多读快速切换）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>共享存储一写多读，主故障只读节点快速提升，RTO 秒级 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RPO≈0（Redo 日志共享）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>切换对长连接有闪断，应用需重连 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Single-writer multi-reader fast failover). Shared-storage single-writer multi-reader; readers promote in seconds on primary failure <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. RPO≈0 (sha…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Single-writer multi-reader fast failover).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Shared-storage single-writer multi-reader; readers promote in seconds on primary failure <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RPO≈0 (shared redo log) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Long connections flap on failover; apps must reconnect <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（继承PG/MySQL生态；云上管控增强）。 PolarDB PostgreSQL 版继承 PG 原生 RLS；MySQL 版与 MySQL 企业版脱敏组件的对应关系需按版本确认 官方文档 阿里云侧提供 DAS / SQL 审计与敏感数据保护（数据脱敏）等管控面能力 厂商口径 云管控脱敏多作用于控制台 / DMS 查询链路，不等同…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（继承PG/MySQL生态；云上管控增强）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB PostgreSQL 版继承 PG 原生 RLS；MySQL 版与 MySQL 企业版脱敏组件的对应关系需按版本确认 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>阿里云侧提供 DAS / SQL 审计与敏感数据保护（数据脱敏）等管控面能力 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>云管控脱敏多作用于控制台 / DMS 查询链路，不等同于引擎内策略 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Inherits PG/MySQL; cloud controls added). PolarDB for PostgreSQL inherits native PG RLS; the MySQL edition&#x27;s parity with MySQL Enterprise masking must be confirm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Inherits PG/MySQL; cloud controls added).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB for PostgreSQL inherits native PG RLS; the MySQL edition&#x27;s parity with MySQL Enterprise masking must be confirmed per version <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Alibaba Cloud adds control-plane capabilities such as DAS / SQL audit and sensitive-data masking <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Cloud-side masking mostly applies to console / DMS query paths, not engine-internal policies <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（MySQL/PG 版各自继承）。 MySQL 版原生 JSON；PG 版 jsonb 官方文档。 能力与上游对齐，无额外增强 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（MySQL/PG 版各自继承）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 版原生 JSON；PG 版 jsonb <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>能力与上游对齐，无额外增强 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Inherited per engine). MySQL flavor native JSON; PG flavor jsonb <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Aligned with upstream, no extra enhancements <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Inherited per engine).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL flavor native JSON; PG flavor jsonb <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Aligned with upstream, no extra enhancements <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（FULLTEXT/tsvector 继承）。 MySQL 版 FULLTEXT+ngram；PG 版 tsvector 官方文档。 大规模检索同样建议外挂 OpenSearch 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（FULLTEXT/tsvector 继承）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 版 FULLTEXT+ngram；PG 版 tsvector <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大规模检索同样建议外挂 OpenSearch <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Inherited FULLTEXT/tsvector). MySQL flavor FULLTEXT+ngram; PG flavor tsvector <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Large-scale search still wants OpenSearch <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Inherited FULLTEXT/tsvector).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL flavor FULLTEXT+ngram; PG flavor tsvector <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Large-scale search still wants OpenSearch <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（官方文档 + 社区实测）。分层机制：① 云管控层：RAM 子账号授权、IP 白名单、安全组/VPC 隔离；② 数据库层：高权限账号（一个实例仅一个）与普通账号（CreateAccount/ModifyAccountPrivilege），MySQL 8.0 增强密码管理（官方发布说明）；③ PG/Oracle 版有专属权限参数：社区实测…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（官方文档 + 社区实测）。分层机制：① 云管控层：RAM 子账号授权、IP 白名单、安全组/VPC 隔离；② 数据库层：高权限账号（一个实例仅一个）与普通账号（<code>CreateAccount</code>/<code>ModifyAccountPrivilege</code>），MySQL 8.0 增强密码管理（官方发布说明）；③ PG/Oracle 版有专属权限参数：社区实测 PolarFlex（PolarDB-PG 轻量版）内核存在大量 <code>polar_*</code> 专属参数（含 <code>polar_acl_*</code> 权限安全），原生 PG 没有；④ 支持三权分立开关（官方 API <code>EnableRightsSeparation</code>，适用引擎版本待验证）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (official docs + community-tested). Layered mechanism: ① cloud control plane: RAM sub-account authorization, IP whitelists, security groups/VPC isolation; ② dat…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (official docs + community-tested). Layered mechanism: ① cloud control plane: RAM sub-account authorization, IP whitelists, security groups/VPC isolation; ② database layer: privileged accounts (one per instance) and standard accounts (<code>CreateAccount</code>/<code>ModifyAccountPrivilege</code>), enhanced password management in MySQL 8.0 (official release notes); ③ PG/Oracle editions have dedicated permission parameters: community testing found that the PolarFlex (lightweight PolarDB-PG edition) kernel contains many <code>polar_*</code>-specific parameters (including <code>polar_acl_*</code> permission/security ones) not present in vanilla PG; ④ supports a separation-of-duties switch (official API <code>EnableRightsSeparation</code>, applicable engine versions to-be-verified).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（共享存储+PolarStore 数据压缩）。 底层 PolarStore 分布式共享存储支持数据压缩与快照克隆，存储按量计费。官方文档 MySQL 版继承 InnoDB 压缩能力；PG 版继承 TOAST 压缩。官方文档 存储层压缩细节不完全公开，压缩比以云账单口径体现，用户侧可观测性有限。待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（共享存储+PolarStore 数据压缩）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>底层 PolarStore 分布式共享存储支持数据压缩与快照克隆，存储按量计费。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>MySQL 版继承 InnoDB 压缩能力；PG 版继承 TOAST 压缩。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>存储层压缩细节不完全公开，压缩比以云账单口径体现，用户侧可观测性有限。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Shared storage plus PolarStore data compression). The underlying PolarStore distributed shared storage supports data compression and snapshot cloning with usag…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Shared storage plus PolarStore data compression).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The underlying PolarStore distributed shared storage supports data compression and snapshot cloning with usage-based storage billing. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>The MySQL edition inherits InnoDB compression; the PostgreSQL edition inherits TOAST compression. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Storage-layer compression details are not fully public; ratios surface through cloud billing with limited user-side observability. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（阿里云绑定；开源版功能受限）。 PolarDB 是阿里云托管数据库服务，存储计算分离架构深度绑定阿里云基础设施，无法迁出该云。官方文档 存在开源版本（PolarDB for PostgreSQL/MySQL），但云上高级特性（极速扩展、HTAP 等）不完全对等。社区共识 迁移出需重构存储层，TDSQL 同理为腾讯云绑定。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（阿里云绑定；开源版功能受限）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB 是阿里云托管数据库服务，存储计算分离架构深度绑定阿里云基础设施，无法迁出该云。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>存在开源版本（PolarDB for PostgreSQL/MySQL），但云上高级特性（极速扩展、HTAP 等）不完全对等。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>迁移出需重构存储层，TDSQL 同理为腾讯云绑定。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Alibaba Cloud-bound; open edition feature-limited). PolarDB is an Alibaba Cloud managed database service; its storage-compute-separated architecture is deeply …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Alibaba Cloud-bound; open edition feature-limited).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB is an Alibaba Cloud managed database service; its storage-compute-separated architecture is deeply bound to Alibaba Cloud infrastructure and cannot leave that cloud. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Open-source editions exist (PolarDB for PostgreSQL/MySQL) but are not fully equivalent to cloud-only features like instant scaling and HTAP. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Migrating out requires re-architecting the storage layer; TDSQL is similarly Tencent Cloud-bound. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（MySQL/PG 衍生+并行/HTAP 增强）。 继承引擎优化器，PolarDB 增加并行查询、IMCI 列存索引的优化器适配 官方文档。 hint 行为同原生引擎 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（MySQL/PG 衍生+并行/HTAP 增强）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>继承引擎优化器，PolarDB 增加并行查询、IMCI 列存索引的优化器适配 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>hint 行为同原生引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (MySQL/PG-derived + parallel/HTAP boosts). Inherits engine optimizers; PolarDB adds parallel query and IMCI columnar-index optimizer support <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Hi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (MySQL/PG-derived + parallel/HTAP boosts).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Inherits engine optimizers; PolarDB adds parallel query and IMCI columnar-index optimizer support <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Hint behavior matches native engines <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（DAS 自动诊断：索引推荐+SQL 优化）。 阿里云 DAS 提供自动 SQL 优化、索引推荐、空间分析 官方文档。 参数组可调，自治能力在国产云库中突出 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（DAS 自动诊断：索引推荐+SQL 优化）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>阿里云 DAS 提供自动 SQL 优化、索引推荐、空间分析 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>参数组可调，自治能力在国产云库中突出 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (DAS auto-diagnosis: index advisor + SQL tuning). Alibaba DAS offers automatic SQL tuning, index recommendations, space analysis <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Tunable parame…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (DAS auto-diagnosis: index advisor + SQL tuning).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Alibaba DAS offers automatic SQL tuning, index recommendations, space analysis <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Tunable parameter groups; notably autonomous among China cloud DBs <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（云厂商底层兜底，用户无可见校验开关）。 存储计算分离架构下，分布式存储层做多副本冗余与底层校验，用户无页校验开关。官方文档 MySQL 版继承 InnoDB 页 checksum，但存储卸载后部分语义由云层接管。厂商口径 损坏审计与主动全库校验能力对用户不可见。待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（云厂商底层兜底，用户无可见校验开关）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储计算分离架构下，分布式存储层做多副本冗余与底层校验，用户无页校验开关。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>MySQL 版继承 InnoDB 页 checksum，但存储卸载后部分语义由云层接管。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>损坏审计与主动全库校验能力对用户不可见。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cloud checks; no user controls). In the disaggregated storage-compute architecture, the distributed storage layer handles replication and low-level checks; no us…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cloud checks; no user controls).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In the disaggregated storage-compute architecture, the distributed storage layer handles replication and low-level checks; no user page-checksum switch. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>The MySQL edition inherits InnoDB page checksums, partly superseded by the offloaded storage layer. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Corruption auditing and proactive full-database verification are not visible to users. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（SP/触发器继承；PG 版 plpgsql）。 MySQL 版 SP/触发器/事件；PG 版 plpgsql 完整 官方文档。 去 O 改写成本与上游一致 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（SP/触发器继承；PG 版 plpgsql）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 版 SP/触发器/事件；PG 版 plpgsql 完整 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>去 O 改写成本与上游一致 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Inherited SPs; plpgsql on PG). MySQL flavor procedures/triggers/events; PG flavor full plpgsql <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Oracle-migration rewrite cost same as upstream …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Inherited SPs; plpgsql on PG).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL flavor procedures/triggers/events; PG flavor full plpgsql <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Oracle-migration rewrite cost same as upstream <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（外键/CHECK 完整继承上游）。 外键、CHECK 等约束与上游一致 官方文档。 云上大表加约束注意主从延迟与锁 社区实测。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（外键/CHECK 完整继承上游）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外键、CHECK 等约束与上游一致 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>云上大表加约束注意主从延迟与锁 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Fully inherited constraints). FK, CHECK consistent with upstream <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Mind replica lag and locks adding constraints on huge cloud tables (community…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Fully inherited constraints).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FK, CHECK consistent with upstream <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Mind replica lag and locks adding constraints on huge cloud tables <code>(community tested)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（分析 SQL 完整继承）。 MySQL 版 8.0 窗口/CTE；PG 版分析 SQL 完整 官方文档。 HTAP 场景可搭配 PolarDB-X/IMCI 列存 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（分析 SQL 完整继承）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 版 8.0 窗口/CTE；PG 版分析 SQL 完整 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>HTAP 场景可搭配 PolarDB-X/IMCI 列存 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Inherited analytical SQL). MySQL flavor 8.0 windows/CTEs; PG flavor complete <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. HTAP via PolarDB-X/IMCI columnar <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Inherited analytical SQL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL flavor 8.0 windows/CTEs; PG flavor complete <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>HTAP via PolarDB-X/IMCI columnar <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（手动DELETE；云备份快照残留）。 引擎层删除语义与 PG / MySQL 一致，无原生擦除证明 社区共识 PolarDB 的共享存储快照与备份集保留策略决定历史副本存活期，合规删除需联动调整备份保留期 官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（手动DELETE；云备份快照残留）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>引擎层删除语义与 PG / MySQL 一致，无原生擦除证明 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>PolarDB 的共享存储快照与备份集保留策略决定历史副本存活期，合规删除需联动调整备份保留期 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Manual DELETE; cloud snapshot residue). Engine-level delete semantics match PG / MySQL; no native erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span> Shared-storage snapsh…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Manual DELETE; cloud snapshot residue).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Engine-level delete semantics match PG / MySQL; no native erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Shared-storage snapshots and backup-set retention policies decide how long historical copies live; compliant deletion must coordinate backup retention <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（DataWorks 数据地图集成）。 通过 DataWorks 数据地图做血缘 官方文档。 无数据库原生列级血缘 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（DataWorks 数据地图集成）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>通过 DataWorks 数据地图做血缘 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无数据库原生列级血缘 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (DataWorks data-map integration). Lineage via DataWorks data map <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native database column-level lineage <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (DataWorks data-map integration).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Lineage via DataWorks data map <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native database column-level lineage <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。机制：① 数据备份（快照，存于 PolarDB 分布式存储，一级备份）：默认开启不可关闭，保留 3 天～730 天；二级备份（存于 OSS）：默认关闭，保留 30 天～7300 天（标准版集群仅支持一级备份，不支持二级备份）；② 日志备份：Redo 日志实时并行上传 OSS，默认开启同地域、不可关闭，保留 3 天～7300…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。机制：① <strong>数据备份</strong>（快照，存于 PolarDB 分布式存储，一级备份）：默认开启<strong>不可关闭</strong>，保留 3 天～730 天；<strong>二级备份</strong>（存于 OSS）：默认关闭，保留 30 天～7300 天（标准版集群仅支持一级备份，不支持二级备份）；② <strong>日志备份</strong>：Redo 日志实时并行上传 OSS，默认开启同地域、不可关闭，保留 3 天～7300 天，支持跨地域备份；③ PITR：全量快照 + 日志备份可恢复到<strong>任意时间点</strong>；MySQL 5.7（5.7.1.0.8+）/8.0 支持<strong>库表级恢复</strong>（按备份集恢复、按时间点恢复）。恢复速度：官方口径——应用 Redo 日志的恢复速度约 20~70 秒/GB<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>，总恢复时间 = 快照恢复 + 日志应用。备份系统具 WORM 不可篡改特性（防篡改）；自动备份不可完全删除（最低保留 3 天、每周至少 2 次）。<strong>注意</strong>：官方文档实锤的坑——二级备份转存失败时，到期的下一个一级备份会被<strong>直接删除</strong>而不是转存，大库用户可能无声丢失备份链。社区实测（PG 版）：PITR 以&quot;全备份 + 重做日志&quot;恢复到<strong>新集群</strong>，不覆盖原集群，且恢复集群不携带源集群参数设置。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Mechanism: ① Data backups (snapshots stored on PolarDB distributed storage, Level-1 backups): enabled by default and cannot be disabled, retain…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Mechanism: ① <strong>Data backups</strong> (snapshots stored on PolarDB distributed storage, Level-1 backups): enabled by default and <strong>cannot be disabled</strong>, retained 3 days–730 days; <strong>Level-2 backups</strong> (stored on OSS): disabled by default, retained 30 days–7300 days (Standard Edition clusters support only Level-1 backups, not Level-2); ② <strong>Log backups</strong>: redo logs uploaded to OSS in real time and in parallel, enabled by default in the same region, cannot be disabled, retained 3 days–7300 days, supports cross-region backup; ③ PITR: full snapshots + log backups can restore to <strong>any point in time</strong>; MySQL 5.7 (5.7.1.0.8+) / 8.0 support <strong>database/table-level restore</strong> (restore from backup set, restore to a point in time). Recovery speed: official statement — applying redo logs recovers at about 20–70 seconds/GB <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>; total recovery time = snapshot restore + log apply. The backup system has WORM immutability (tamper-proof); automatic backups cannot be fully deleted (minimum 3-day retention, at least twice per week). <strong>Note</strong>: a documented-in-official-docs pitfall — when a Level-2 backup transfer fails, the expiring next Level-1 backup is <strong>deleted directly</strong> instead of being transferred, so large-database users may silently lose their backup chain. Community-tested (PG edition): PITR restores via &quot;full backup + redo logs&quot; to a <strong>new cluster</strong>, never overwriting the original cluster, and the restored cluster does not inherit the source cluster&#x27;s parameter settings.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存算分离：PolarStore 共享存储）。 计算与 PolarStore 分布式共享存储分离，一写多读 官方文档。 只读节点秒级扩展不搬数据 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存算分离：PolarStore 共享存储）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>计算与 PolarStore 分布式共享存储分离，一写多读 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>只读节点秒级扩展不搬数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Disaggregated: PolarStore shared storage). Compute separated from PolarStore distributed shared storage; single-write multi-read <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Read replicas…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Disaggregated: PolarStore shared storage).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Compute separated from PolarStore distributed shared storage; single-write multi-read <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Read replicas scale in seconds without data movement <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（随引擎：JSON/PG 向量生态）。 PolarDB-PG 支持 pgvector 等 PG 生态 官方文档。 无原生图/全文独立引擎 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（随引擎：JSON/PG 向量生态）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB-PG 支持 pgvector 等 PG 生态 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生图/全文独立引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Engine-dependent: JSON/PG vector ecosystem). PolarDB-PG supports pgvector and the PG ecosystem <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No standalone native graph/full-text engine (comm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Engine-dependent: JSON/PG vector ecosystem).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PolarDB-PG supports pgvector and the PG ecosystem <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No standalone native graph/full-text engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（阿里云账单标签+费用中心+预算告警）。 支持费用标签与资源组归因，费用中心可做多账号分账。官方文档 按存储与计算规格计费，预算告警支持阈值通知。官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（阿里云账单标签+费用中心+预算告警）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持费用标签与资源组归因，费用中心可做多账号分账。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>按存储与计算规格计费，预算告警支持阈值通知。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Alibaba tags, cost center, budgets). Cost tags and resource groups enable attribution; the cost center supports multi-account chargeback. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Bille…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Alibaba tags, cost center, budgets).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cost tags and resource groups enable attribution; the cost center supports multi-account chargeback. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Billed by storage and compute specification, with threshold-based budget alerts. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（MySQL/PG 协议兼容）。 完全兼容 MySQL/PG 协议与驱动 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（MySQL/PG 协议兼容）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完全兼容 MySQL/PG 协议与驱动 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (MySQL/PG protocol compatible). Fully compatible with MySQL/PG protocols and drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (MySQL/PG protocol compatible).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Fully compatible with MySQL/PG protocols and drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（PG 版手动物化视图；MySQL 版无）。 PG 版：物化视图手动 REFRESH 官方文档。 MySQL 版：无，汇总表模拟 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（PG 版手动物化视图；MySQL 版无）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PG 版：物化视图手动 REFRESH <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>MySQL 版：无，汇总表模拟 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Manual MVs on PG; none on MySQL). PG flavor: manual-REFRESH materialized views <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. MySQL flavor: none; summary tables instead <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Manual MVs on PG; none on MySQL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PG flavor: manual-REFRESH materialized views <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>MySQL flavor: none; summary tables instead <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（阿里云绑定，无跨云）。 仅阿里云提供 官方文档。 迁出靠逻辑迁移，无跨云复制 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（阿里云绑定，无跨云）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>仅阿里云提供 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>迁出靠逻辑迁移，无跨云复制 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Alibaba Cloud-bound; no cross-cloud). Alibaba Cloud only <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Moving out via logical migration; no cross-cloud replication (community consensus…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Alibaba Cloud-bound; no cross-cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Alibaba Cloud only <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Moving out via logical migration; no cross-cloud replication <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（hotspot 参数与 Statement Queue 机制）。 MySQL 线并发原语：InnoDB 行级记录锁，后来者排队等待（受 innodb_lock_wait_timeout 限制）；死锁由内核检测并回滚一方（报 1213），重试由应用负责；热点行即串行单点，吞吐随并发度趋平 官方文档。 内置缓解一：hotspot 参数（默…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（hotspot 参数与 Statement Queue 机制）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL 线并发原语：InnoDB 行级记录锁，后来者排队等待（受 innodb_lock_wait_timeout 限制）；死锁由内核检测并回滚一方（报 1213），重试由应用负责；热点行即串行单点，吞吐随并发度趋平 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>内置缓解一：hotspot 参数（默认 OFF，控制台为 loose_hotspot）开启热行优化，需配合 Hint 使用——COMMIT_ON_SUCCESS（成功自动提交，必填）、ROLLBACK_ON_FAIL、TARGET_AFFECT_ROW(1)，以缩短单行更新的持锁时间 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>内置缓解二：Statement Queue 把冲突的 DML 按哈希路由进共享桶排队，语句在队列中等待而非反复加锁/释放；官方测试 128 并发单行 UPDATE 约为标准 MySQL 的 4 倍；与 hotspot 二选一（hotspot 开启时自动旁路），要求 8.0.1.1.10+ / 5.7.1.0.6+ / 5.6 20200601+ 版本 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>衰减与边界：两种机制都只缓解锁管理开销，不消除热点行的串行本质；Statement Queue 对无冲突负载无效；极端热点下仍是单行串行，吞吐上限由单行更新速度决定 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>应用层模式与代价：计数器分片、合并写、队列削峰；PolarDB 官方还推荐基于 SQL 的 CCL 并发控制规则做限流；代价是读聚合复杂度与限流带来的排队延迟 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (hotspot parameter plus Statement Queue, two mechanisms). MySQL line concurrency primitive: InnoDB row-level record locks, later writers queue (bounded by innod…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (hotspot parameter plus Statement Queue, two mechanisms).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MySQL line concurrency primitive: InnoDB row-level record locks, later writers queue (bounded by innodb_lock_wait_timeout); deadlocks are detected by the engine with one side rolled back (1213) and the application retries; a hot row is a serialization point where throughput flattens with concurrency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Built-in mitigation one: the hotspot parameter (default OFF, loose_hotspot in the console) enables hot-row optimization and must be combined with hints — COMMIT_ON_SUCCESS (auto-commit on success, required), ROLLBACK_ON_FAIL, TARGET_AFFECT_ROW(1) — to shorten lock hold time for single-row updates <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Built-in mitigation two: Statement Queue routes conflicting DML into shared hash buckets so statements wait in a queue instead of repeatedly acquiring and releasing locks; official tests show about 4x the throughput of standard MySQL at 128 concurrent single-row UPDATEs; it is mutually exclusive with hotspot (bypassed when hotspot is ON) and requires 8.0.1.1.10+ / 5.7.1.0.6+ / 5.6 20200601+ <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Decay and limits: both mechanisms only reduce lock-management overhead and do not remove the serial nature of a hot row; Statement Queue does nothing for non-conflicting workloads; under extreme hotspots the row stays serial and throughput is capped by single-row update speed <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Application patterns and cost: counter sharding, write merging, queue-based peak shaving, plus PolarDB&#x27;s SQL-based CCL concurrency-control rules for throttling; costs are read aggregation complexity and queueing delay from throttling <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。① 控制台监控：CPU/内存/IOPS/连接数/复制延迟等指标（云监控集成）；② DAS（数据库自治服务）：性能洞察、慢 SQL 明细查询（API DescribeSlowLogRecords、DescribeDBNodePerformance）；③ 慢日志控制台查询、show processlist；④ 事件与运维任务（…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。① 控制台监控：CPU/内存/IOPS/连接数/复制延迟等指标（云监控集成）；② <strong>DAS（数据库自治服务）</strong>：性能洞察、慢 SQL 明细查询（API <code>DescribeSlowLogRecords</code>、<code>DescribeDBNodePerformance</code>）；③ 慢日志控制台查询、<code>show processlist</code>；④ 事件与运维任务（<code>DescribeEvents</code>、<code>DescribeActiveOperationTasks</code>）；⑤ 复制链路健康检查（<code>CreateRplInspectionTask</code>）。MySQL 5.6/8.0 支持语句并发控制（Statement Concurrency Control）限流问题 SQL（官方 FAQ）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. ① Console monitoring: CPU/memory/IOPS/connections/replication lag and other metrics (integrated with CloudMonitor); ② DAS (Database Autonomy Se…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. ① Console monitoring: CPU/memory/IOPS/connections/replication lag and other metrics (integrated with CloudMonitor); ② <strong>DAS (Database Autonomy Service)</strong>: performance insights, slow-SQL detail queries (APIs <code>DescribeSlowLogRecords</code>, <code>DescribeDBNodePerformance</code>); ③ slow-log console queries, <code>show processlist</code>; ④ events and ops tasks (<code>DescribeEvents</code>, <code>DescribeActiveOperationTasks</code>); ⑤ replication-link health checks (<code>CreateRplInspectionTask</code>). MySQL 5.6/8.0 supports Statement Concurrency Control to throttle problematic SQL (official FAQ).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（官方文档 + 社区共识）。三种地址：主地址（读写）、集群地址（PolarProxy 自动读写分离：写→主节点、读→按负载分发到主/只读节点）、自定义集群地址（可隔离业务）；集群地址支持会话级连接池（官方 FAQ：高并发 PHP 短连接可在集群地址开启会话级连接池优化）；社区/官方一致建议应用侧仍使用连接池（社区共识：长连接 + 合理池…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（官方文档 + 社区共识）。三种地址：主地址（读写）、<strong>集群地址</strong>（PolarProxy 自动读写分离：写→主节点、读→按负载分发到主/只读节点）、自定义集群地址（可隔离业务）；<strong>集群地址支持会话级连接池</strong>（官方 FAQ：高并发 PHP 短连接可在集群地址开启会话级连接池优化）；社区/官方一致建议应用侧仍使用连接池（社区共识：长连接 + 合理池大小）。注意：PolarProxy 代理层连接≠后端直连，<strong>故障切换时旧主节点主动断开所有连接</strong>（官方文档明确为预期行为），应用需重连。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (official docs + community consensus). Three endpoint types: primary endpoint (read-write), cluster endpoint (PolarProxy automatic read/write splitting: writes …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (official docs + community consensus). Three endpoint types: primary endpoint (read-write), <strong>cluster endpoint</strong> (PolarProxy automatic read/write splitting: writes → primary, reads → distributed across primary/read-only nodes by load), custom cluster endpoints (isolate workloads); <strong>the cluster endpoint supports session-level connection pooling</strong> (official FAQ: high-concurrency PHP short-connection workloads can enable session-level connection pooling on the cluster endpoint for optimization); community and official guidance agree apps should still use their own connection pools (community consensus: long-lived connections + sane pool sizing). Note: PolarProxy-layer connections ≠ direct backend connections — <strong>during failover the old primary actively disconnects all connections</strong> (official docs state this is expected behavior), applications must reconnect.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。MySQL：继承 InnoDB 事务模型：ACID、MVCC、4 种标准隔离级别；8.0 支持原子 DDL 等原生特性。PG：标准 PG MVCC 事务模型与隔离级别。Oracle：Oracle 兼容事务语义，支持 PL/SQL 存储过程/函数/触发器异常处理（开发者社区文章）；具体隔离级别映射细节待验证。集群地…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。MySQL：继承 InnoDB 事务模型：ACID、MVCC、4 种标准隔离级别；8.0 支持原子 DDL 等原生特性。PG：标准 PG MVCC 事务模型与隔离级别。Oracle：Oracle 兼容事务语义，支持 PL/SQL 存储过程/函数/触发器异常处理（开发者社区文章）；具体隔离级别映射细节待验证。集群地址支持<strong>一致性级别</strong>设置（会话一致性/全局一致性/最终一致性，官方文档）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (official docs / community consensus). MySQL: inherits the InnoDB transaction model — ACID, MVCC, 4 standard isolation levels; 8.0 supports atomic DDL and other…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (official docs / community consensus). MySQL: inherits the InnoDB transaction model — ACID, MVCC, 4 standard isolation levels; 8.0 supports atomic DDL and other native features. PG: standard PG MVCC transaction model and isolation levels. Oracle: Oracle-compatible transaction semantics, supports PL/SQL stored procedures/functions/trigger exception handling (Alibaba Cloud developer community articles); exact isolation-level mapping details to-be-verified. The cluster endpoint supports <strong>consistency level</strong> settings (session consistency / global consistency / eventual consistency, official docs).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。共享存储（Shared Everything）+ 物理复制：所有计算节点共享同一份 PolarStore/PolarFS 分布式存储（三副本，RPO=0 为厂商口径）；主从节点间只需同步 Redo 日志元数据（MySQL）/ WAL（PG），只读节点应用物理日志，复制延迟通常为毫秒级<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>；故障时只读节点快速提升为主…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。<strong>共享存储（Shared Everything）+ 物理复制</strong>：所有计算节点共享同一份 PolarStore/PolarFS 分布式存储（三副本，RPO=0 为厂商口径）；主从节点间只需同步 Redo 日志元数据（MySQL）/ WAL（PG），只读节点应用物理日志，复制延迟通常为毫秒级<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>；故障时只读节点快速提升为主，RTO&lt;60 秒为厂商口径。读一致性通过 MVCC 跨节点保证。<strong>部分待验证</strong>：跨地域 GDN（全球数据库网络）的复制协议细节未深入查证。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Shared storage (shared-everything) + physical replication: all compute nodes share the same PolarStore/PolarFS distributed storage (3 replicas,…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. <strong>Shared storage (shared-everything) + physical replication</strong>: all compute nodes share the same PolarStore/PolarFS distributed storage (3 replicas, RPO=0 is a vendor claim); primary and secondary nodes only need to sync redo log metadata (MySQL) / WAL (PG); read-only nodes apply physical logs, replication lag is typically millisecond-level <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>; on failure a read-only node is promoted to primary quickly, RTO&lt;60 seconds is a vendor claim. Read consistency is guaranteed via MVCC across nodes. <strong>Partially to-be-verified</strong>: replication protocol details for cross-region GDN (Global Database Network) were not deeply verified.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "polardb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。纵向：计算节点规格升降配在线进行（分钟级）；存储按实际用量自动扩容，无需预置（PG/Oracle 版默认最高 500TB，可扩展至 PB 级，厂商口径）。横向：只读节点秒级添加（共享存储，无需数据拷贝），一写多读最多 15 个只读节点<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。横向写扩展：集中式三引擎为单主写，写扩展需走 PolarDB-X（见文末澄清…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。<strong>纵向</strong>：计算节点规格升降配在线进行（分钟级）；存储按实际用量自动扩容，无需预置（PG/Oracle 版默认最高 500TB，可扩展至 PB 级，厂商口径）。<strong>横向</strong>：只读节点秒级添加（共享存储，无需数据拷贝），一写多读最多 15 个只读节点<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。<strong>横向写扩展</strong>：集中式三引擎为单主写，写扩展需走 PolarDB-X（见文末澄清）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Vertical: compute node spec upgrades/downgrades performed online (minute-level); storage auto-expands with actual usage, no pre-provisioning (P…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. <strong>Vertical</strong>: compute node spec upgrades/downgrades performed online (minute-level); storage auto-expands with actual usage, no pre-provisioning (PG/Oracle editions default up to 500TB, extendable to PB-level per vendor claim). <strong>Horizontal</strong>: read-only nodes added in seconds (shared storage, no data copy), up to 15 read-only nodes in single-writer/multi-reader <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. <strong>Horizontal write scaling</strong>: the centralized three engines are single-primary-write; write scaling requires PolarDB-X (see clarification at the end).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无（查证为无）</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无）——社区版无原生透明数据加密，是 PG 最著名的长期缺口之一；静态加密靠文件系统/云盘加密或商业发行版实现。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（无此功能）+ 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无（查证为无）</strong>——社区版无原生透明数据加密，是 PG 最著名的长期缺口之一；静态加密靠文件系统/云盘加密或商业发行版实现。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（无此功能）+ 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (confirmed absent) — the community edition has no native transparent data encryption, one of PG&#x27;s most famous long-standing gaps; encryption at rest relies …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported (confirmed absent)</strong> — the community edition has no native transparent data encryption, one of PG&#x27;s most famous long-standing gaps; encryption at rest relies on filesystem/cloud-disk encryption or commercial distributions. Evidence: official docs (feature absent) + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——TLS/SSL（ssl=on + 证书配置），支持证书认证。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——TLS/SSL（<code>ssl=on</code> + 证书配置），支持证书认证。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — TLS/SSL (ssl=on + certificate configuration), certificate authentication supported. Evidence: official docs.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — TLS/SSL (<code>ssl=on</code> + certificate configuration), certificate authentication supported. Evidence: official docs.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——PG 协议（libpq）为事实标准，驱动/ORM/工具生态最全；FDW 可连外部数据源。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——PG 协议（libpq）为事实标准，驱动/ORM/工具生态最全；FDW 可连外部数据源。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — the PG protocol (libpq) is the de facto standard with the most complete driver/ORM/tool ecosystem; FDW connects to external data sources. Evidence: community …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — the PG protocol (libpq) is the de facto standard with the most complete driver/ORM/tool ecosystem; FDW connects to external data sources. Evidence: community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">PostgreSQL License（宽松）；无官方商业版；商业支持由第三方（EDB 等）或云厂商提供。证据：官方。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>PostgreSQL License（宽松）；<strong>无</strong>官方商业版；商业支持由第三方（EDB 等）或云厂商提供。证据：官方。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No icial commercial e</span><p class=\"snippet\">PostgreSQL License (permissive); no official commercial edition; commercial support from third parties (e.g., EDB) or cloud vendors. Evidence: official.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>PostgreSQL License (permissive); <strong>no</strong> official commercial edition; commercial support from third parties (e.g., EDB) or cloud vendors. Evidence: official.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "postgresql__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（丰富）</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（丰富）——官方文档有中文版、中文社区（postgres.cn）活跃。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有（丰富）</strong>——官方文档有中文版、中文社区（postgres.cn）活跃。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (rich) — official docs have a Chinese edition, and the Chinese community (postgres.cn) is active. Evidence: community consensus.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported (rich)</strong> — official docs have a Chinese edition, and the Chinese community (postgres.cn) is active. Evidence: community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});